tcit ucid="US-5682948-A" status="new"><document-id status="new" format="epo"><country>US</country><doc-number>5682948</doc-number><kind>A</kind></document-id><sources><source category="A" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit><patcit ucid="US-5805417-A" status="new"><document-id status="new" format="epo"><country>US</country><doc-number>5805417</doc-number><kind>A</kind></document-id><sources><source category="A" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit></patent-citations><non-patent-citations><nplcit status="new"><text>See also references of EP     1239359A1</text><sources><source name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></nplcit></non-patent-citations></citations></technical-data><parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>WANG JIUNG JUNG</name><address><country>CN</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>WANG, JIUNG-JUNG</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>WANG JIUNG-JUNG</name><address><country>CN</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>WANG, JIUNG-JUNG</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>It is provided a heat-radiator on the CPU of a portable computer, the mainboard is inverted upside-down and set in the computer housing, the microprocessor, radiator and radiating-fan are fixed on the said mainboard. In addition, two corresponding sides of the radiating flange are open-sides, the fan can be fixed on any of the open-sides, while other faces are close-sides. There are multi-group fins on the socket contacted with the radiation, two fins are reversely convexconcave and there forms a convection slot between two fins. A windbox also can be set to change the fix-position of the fan. This heat-radiator can enlarge the radiating area and achieve the better radiating effect.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un dissipateur thermique pour une unité centrale d'un ordinateur portable, la carte principale sur laquelle sont placés l'UC, le dissipateur thermique et le ventilateur a été inversée puis disposée dans le boîtier de l'ordinateur. La plaque de refroidissement du dissipateur présente deux bords à surfaces libres, chacune pouvant recevoir le ventilateur, et à surfaces scellées. La pluralité d'aubes reliées au socle en contact avec le corps de diffusion présente deux aubes inversées convexes et concaves qui définissent une fente de convection à écoulement d'air haute température. On prévoit aussi une boîte d'aspiration servant à modifier la position des aubes. Ce dissipateur thermique permet d'augmenter la surface de dissipation thermique et d'assurer un meilleur rendement de refroidissement.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>